        "subtitle": "Optimized for High-Volume Efficiency",
        "secondary_description": "<p>Heavy-duty dependability is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the rapid heating efficiency and thermal precision of the Solo-Pil US, daily surface wiping with a professional citrus-based solvent formulated for high-volume spa environments is recommended. The insulated stainless steel warming core resists harsh residue buildup, ensuring repeatable thermal output across years of rigorous commercial operation. Consistent care delivers service consistency and reduced downtime.</p>",
